bhāgavatī,
(1) (in Skt., a [female] follower of Viṣṇu, or also acc. to Schmidt, Nachtr., of Śiva; perhaps so here), a female follower of Viṣṇu (?): Vasumitrā nāma bhāgavatī Gv 〔201.11〕; similarly Vasumitrā bhāgavatī 〔201.26 ff.〕;
(2) n. of a cāturdvīpikā, q.v. (world-system of four continents; in 〔373.17〕 and 〔381.4—5〕 specifically includes a continent Jambudvīpa): Gv 〔373.17〕; 〔379.25〕; 〔381.4—5〕; 〔438.26〕.
